        slug: "why-do-i-hate-myself",
        title: "Why Do I Hate Myself So Much—And How Do I Get Rid of This Feeling?",
        excerpt: "Self-hatred is a learned pattern of internal criticism and emotional neglect. Learn how to stop treating yourself like the enemy.",
        category: "Wellness",
