        excerpt: "Lifestyle change is not an overnight transformation—it's a gradual shift in how you live and think. Learn how to embrace discomfort, set realistic goals, and build sustainable habits.",
        category: "Wellness",
        date: "April 19, 2026",
        image: "assets/blog/how-to-bring-change-in-lifestyle.jpg",
